---
import PageHead from '@/components/page-head.astro'
import TitleReveal from '@/components/title-reveal.astro'
import { CONTACT } from '@/consts'
import Layout from '@/layouts/layout.astro'

const email = CONTACT.email.trim()
const formAction =
  CONTACT.formEndpoint.trim() ||
  (email ? `https://formsubmit.co/${encodeURIComponent(email)}` : '')
const formReady = Boolean(formAction)
const sent = Astro.url.searchParams.get('sent') === '1'
const nextUrl = new URL('/contact/?sent=1', Astro.site).toString()
---

<Layout class="max-w-5xl">
  <PageHead
    slot="head"
    title="CONTACT"
    description="联系未来游戏研究所，提出合作、内容纠错或加入意向。"
  />

  <article class="contact-document">
    <header class="contact-heading">
      <TitleReveal text="CONTACT" />
    </header>

    <div class="contact-intro">
      <p>感谢你访问未来游戏研究所。</p>
      <p>研究合作、内容纠错、活动邀请、加入意向与其他咨询，请使用下方表单。</p>
      <p><span aria-hidden="true">*</span> 表示必填项。</p>
    </div>

    {
      sent && (
        <p class="contact-result" role="status">
          信息已经发送。感谢你的来信，我们会在阅读后回复。
        </p>
      )
    }

    <form
      class="contact-form"
      action={formReady ? formAction : undefined}
      method="POST"
      accept-charset="UTF-8"
    >
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="未来游戏研究所网站联系表单" />
      <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />
      <input type="hidden" name="_next" value={nextUrl} />
      <label class="contact-honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
        请勿填写
        <input type="text" name="_honey" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
      </label>

      <label>
        <span>你的姓名 <i aria-hidden="true">*</i></span>
        <input
          type="text"
          name="name"
          autocomplete="name"
          maxlength="80"
          required
        />
      </label>

      <label>
        <span>电子邮件地址 <i aria-hidden="true">*</i></span>
        <input
          type="email"
          name="email"
          autocomplete="email"
          maxlength="160"
          required
        />
      </label>

      <label>
        <span>公司名称 / 组织名称</span>
        <input
          type="text"
          name="organization"
          autocomplete="organization"
          maxlength="120"
        />
      </label>

      <label>
        <span>电话号码</span>
        <input
          type="tel"
          name="phone"
          autocomplete="tel"
          inputmode="tel"
          maxlength="40"
        />
      </label>

      <label>
        <span>你的咨询 <i aria-hidden="true">*</i></span>
        <textarea name="message" rows="12" maxlength="4000" required></textarea>
      </label>

      {
        !formReady && (
          <p class="contact-configuration" id="contact-configuration">
            表单收件地址正在配置中。
          </p>
        )
      }

      <button
        class="signal-control"
        type="submit"
        disabled={!formReady}
        aria-describedby={!formReady ? 'contact-configuration' : undefined}
      >
        发送
      </button>
    </form>

    <p class="contact-note">
      请不要提交密码、访问令牌、证件号码或其他不应通过普通电子邮件传输的敏感信息。
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .contact-document {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 48rem;
    padding-bottom: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .contact-heading {
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--foreground);
    padding-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }

  .contact-heading :global(h1) {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.8rem);
    font-weight: 760;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .contact-intro {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin-top: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .contact-intro p:last-child,
  .contact-intro p:last-child span,
  .contact-form i {
    color: var(--signal-magenta-ink);
  }

  .contact-result,
  .contact-configuration {
    border: 1px solid var(--foreground);
    background: var(--background);
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .contact-result {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    box-shadow:
      2px 2px 0 var(--signal-magenta),
      -2px -2px 0 var(--signal-cyan);
  }

  .contact-form {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.4rem;
    margin-top: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem);
  }

  .contact-form label:not(.contact-honeypot) {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .contact-form label > span {
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .contact-form i {
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .contact-form input,
  .contact-form textarea {
    width: 100%;
    border-color: #74787c;
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem;
  }

  .contact-form textarea {
    min-height: 16rem;
    resize: vertical;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .contact-honeypot {
    position: absolute;
    left: -10000px;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .contact-configuration {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .contact-form button {
    min-height: 3.15rem;
    border-color: var(--foreground);
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--foreground);
    color: var(--background);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .contact-form button:disabled {
    border-color: var(--border);
    background: var(--muted);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .contact-note {
    margin-top: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>
